// [CR#120.3c,306.8]: damage dealt to a planeswalker causes that many loyalty
// counters to be removed from it. This is a damage RESULT (applied at deal
// time), not a replacement effect, and is additive with any intrinsic result
// ([CR#120.3]: "one or more results") — a creature-planeswalker is marked AND
// loses loyalty. The 0-loyalty SBA ([CR#704.5i], rules/sba/loyalty-zero.ron)
// handles death once the counters reach zero.
[
    DamageResultRule(recipient: Type("Planeswalker"), remove: LoyaltyCounter),
]
